      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I have changed the chatbox visibility between friends and everyone.  Settings are attached.  Still when people are typing I see red dots but the chatbox never appears.  Build number is now 1447 and same issue.\n\nAre there any other settings that might be affecting this?  I thought this was probably an issue with the Pico version but if it's working for others then I don't know why it isn't working on mine.",
